ly verified. It follows similar IRGC claims on Oct 10 (supertanker) and Oct 14 (container ship).", "url": "https://www.aljazeera.com/news/liveblog/2026/10/17/draft-2", "source": "Al Jazeera / FinancialJuice", "scale": "notable", "category": "conflict", "region": "Middle East", "c": -0.108, "via": "oil"}, {"id": "7cccf2362fe4", "ts": "2026-10-19T18:33:00Z", "title": "Tasnim: Yemeni drone attacks on Dammam halt airport activity", "summary": "Iran's Tasnim News reported Yemeni drone attacks on Dammam in Saudi Arabia's Eastern Province and said activity at Dammam airport was halted; not independently confirmed.", "url": "https://www.financialjuice.com/News/9811830/Yemeni-drone-attacks-on-Dammam-Saudi-Arabia-Dammam-airport-activity-halted---Tasnim-News.aspx?xy=rss", "source": "FinancialJuice / Tasnim", "scale": "minor", "category": "conflict", "region": "Middle East", "c": -0.101, "via": "oil"}, {"id": "abe9106c05b2", "ts": "2026-10-16T18:09:42Z", "title": "Indian official says crude tanker targeted by missile in Strait of Hormuz", "summary": "An Indian shipping official said a crude oil tanker was targeted by a missile in the Strait of Hormuz on Friday and also referred to the recent Romania-linked tanker incident; it adds to this week's string of attacks on Gulf shipping.", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "source": "Newsquawk", "scale": "notable", "category": "conflict", "region": "Middle East", "c": -0.101, "via": "oil"}, {"id": "8cff3a3045a5", "ts": "2026-10-16T14:01:00Z", "title": "Ukrainian drones hit Surgut condensate plant in Russia's largest oil-producing region", "summary": "A suspected Ukrainian drone attack started a fire at an industrial facility in the Surgut district of Khanty-Mansi, identified by residents as Gazprom Pererabotka's Surgut Condensate Stabilization Plant, Russia's largest such facility; it appears to be the first strike on energy infrastructure in the region, and Surgut and Kogalym airports were restricted.", "url": "https://www.themosco